Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='instancefile', at=datetime(2026, 9, 8, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title='The deployment is instance.toml, read only by the binary and checked at startup', body="*The deployment is `instance.toml`*, named in one place (2026-09-08): repo root, `events/` path, actor roster, trust policy, categories, who may read and write the web app, the maildir, the dedup authority, `mbsyncrc`, the last-sync file, and every mail account with its sync strategy. Only the binary reads it: `suzatary-core` and `suzatary-io` never see a path, so a library reaching for a deployment would not compile (`mail::account` holds the account model with no address). Committed, nothing secret (the roster is in every object's `actor`). CHECKED AT STARTUP: a writer the gate would refuse, or one the roster does not know, stops the server. `suzatary doctor` prints what it read; nothing reaches for a singleton.", rationale='Decided 2026-09-08.', supersedes=()))